    "ambiguous": "The image contains conflicting or semantically competing printed amounts; it is excluded from verified precision/coverage denominators and any trusted prediction is reported separately as unsupported.",
    "evaluation": "Only verified field labels are used for precision/coverage. Absent labels test false-positive trust. Ambiguous labels are not treated as correct or incorrect ground truth. This file is not read by training or configuration selection."
